# === AGGREGATION RULE ===

A predicate is load-bearing-failing iff:
  - INCLUSION polarity AND state in {explicit_false, assumed_false}
  - EXCLUSION polarity AND state in {explicit_true, assumed_true}

`unknown_defer` on either polarity is NEVER load-bearing-failing.

Final verdict:
  - INELIGIBLE iff at least one load-bearing-failing predicate exists.
  - Otherwise ELIGIBLE.

